{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"Calligrapher’s Might\nWeapon (longsword), rare, requires attunement\n\nWhen inactive it appears to be a silver embossed fountain pen with a removable glass vial acting as it’s reservoir. As an action you can flush out some of the ink to become the blade of any sword or dagger that does not have the heavy property. Enemies hit by this weapon take an additional damage die of necrotic damage and then must make a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or have their hit points reduced by the necrotic damage until they take a long rest.\n\nYou also gain proficiency in calligraphy tools.","created_at":"2021-08-16T01:51:34.187000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876644324341850193","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"5x Ink Blot 3.0\nwondrous item (consumable)\n\nRounded flasks filled with the deepest darkest black fluid ever beheld. When thrown at an empty square, the flask breaks and the inky black fluid erupts out and creates a 15ft radius of magical darkness that lasts for 10 minutes or until a strong breeze disperses it. Any creature that starts its turn within the ink cloud must make a DC 14 Constitution saving throw or gain the poisoned condition until the start of their next turn. If a creature is already poisoned they take 1d6 poison damage as they gag for fresh air. \n\nA label on the bottle reads: “By using this product you confirm that you are not Anasi Kapur, you are in no way affiliated to Anasi Kapur, you are not using this item on behalf of Anasi Kapur or an associate of Anasi Kapur. To the best of your knowledge, information and belief this material will not make its way into the hands of Anasi Kapur.”","created_at":"2021-08-16T01:51:58.498000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876644426309570590","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
