{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"A Glaxx made of Noirite.\nGlaxx\nWeapon (any axe)\n\nThe blades of this axe are made of a thick tempered glass and sharpened to a fine edge. You can deal additional damage by dropping onto a target. Starting at 20ft you deal an additional damage die and an extra die for every 10ft higher above that to a maximum of 200ft. When dropping this way you still take the fall damage and half as much if you hit your target, if your attack crits you take no fall damage. You cannot be under any slow fall effects when doing the drop attack.\n\nIf made from Noirite, the bonus becomes +3 and any creature of size large or smaller hit by the drop attack must make a DC 15 Con saving throw or the creature gets one of their limbs, not including its head.","created_at":"2021-08-16T01:52:51.846000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"876644650067320842","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
